## Interface: 16001
## Title: Amobi Companion |cffe9cb88阿莫比小幫手|r
## Title-zhTW: |cffe9cb88阿莫比|r 小幫手
## Notes: The wowamobi.com companion for WoW Forever: apply talent builds from the website; boss timeline and warnings set up, pull countdown, your threat; map coordinates and waypoints to the nearest flight master, inn or dungeon; an AtlasLoot-style loot browser; dungeon quests (classic reference: level, quest giver, waypoint); quest helper (nearest quest, quest-mob marks, optional auto accept / turn in); PvP alerts (enemy crowd-control casts and cooldowns read aloud in Chinese, nearby enemy players, a kill list); dungeon cards, cooldown viewer and damage meter layout, post-fight review, target range, cooldown numbers, target health, profession uses on tooltips, a bolder damage font and food / sleeping bag / elixir expiry reminders; in the Amobi guild it records auction prices and boss drops for the website (no player names); on Amobi's Asia PvP-rules realm (Alliance and Horde) it records whom you got honor kills on and sends them to Amobi for a kill ranking (both can be turned off). Never casts, targets or moves for you. /amobi
## Notes-zhTW: 阿莫比網站（wowamobi.com）的《魔獸世界：永恆》遊戲插件：網站天賦一鍵套用；首領時間軸和警告一鍵設定、開怪倒數、我的仇恨；座標、導航到最近的飛行點、旅店、副本入口；像 AtlasLoot 的戰利品查詢；副本任務（經典版參考：幾級可接、誰接、帶路）；任務帶路、名條標任務怪、自動接交任務（打勾才開）；PvP 警報（敵方控場技能中文語音播報、冷卻倒數、附近敵人、必殺名單）；副本小卡、冷卻監控和傷害統計擺好、打完檢討、目標距離、冷卻數字、目標血量、物品專業用途、打怪傷害字型、食物睡袋藥劑快到期提醒；在阿莫比的公會裡記拍賣場物價和首領掉落給網站（沒有玩家名字）；亞服 PvP 規則限定（聯盟、部落都收），記下你榮譽擊殺了誰傳給阿莫比做擊殺排行榜（都可以關）。不會替你施法、選目標或移動。/amobi
